\tr{\td{INFER's front cache (C1-C3)}\td{built, measured (batch 2), REJECTED: -0.3\% to -0.5\% instructions on the libraries, +0.3\% on the Cedar slice, no CPU gain. The code stays behind \code{\verb~|-Drlvm.machine.m5ic=true~} (off) for a re-measurement on a quiet host; if that shows nothing either, it should be deleted}}
